Holds this directory in git without holding its contents.

example/pubspec.yaml declares `assets/`, so the directory has to exist or
`flutter analyze` reports asset_directory_does_not_exist and exits non-zero.
The fixtures that belong here are binaries, generated rather than committed:

    swift tool/make_fixture.swift

That generator is macOS-only, so the Linux analyze job never runs it and would
otherwise always see a missing directory.
